OL,3,GNEWSADoctor who removed ovaries faces
OL,4,Afresh tribunal
OL,5,
OL,6,FA doctor who admitted removing two
OL,7,Fwomen's ovaries without their consent
OL,8,Fis to face a fresh medical tribunal
OL,9,Fafter a High Court judge ruled parts of
OL,10,Fan earlier decision in his case were
OL,11,F"wrong or unjust".
OL,13,FDr Ali Shokouh-Amiri, a consultant
OL,14,Fgynaecologist who previously worked at
OL,15,FGuernsey's Princess Elizabeth Hospital,
OL,16,Fwas found guilty of misconduct by a
OL,17,FMedical Practitioners Tribunal in
OL,18,FFebruary 2025 and given a warning, but
OL,19,Fthe panel concluded his fitness to
OL,20,Fpractise was not impaired.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,442,440,260,160,0,100
