OL,3,GNEWSADoctor who removed ovaries faces
OL,4,Afresh tribunal
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe General Medical Council (GMC)
OL,7,Fchallenged the outcome in the High
OL,8,FCourt.
OL,10,FAfter hearing the appeal, Mr Justice
OL,11,FMorris found the tribunal had made
OL,12,Ferrors in relation to five sets of
OL,13,Fallegations.
